# forge/fit/stars: star rivets (STARFALL, Steppe, Starspire; 28.3): four-point stars, a lit cross round a bright heart,
# on the panel (one, two or three).
# FORGE-MARKS, forge i2 (tools: emb_P2c/forge/areas/FORGE-MARKS/tools2/mk2.py). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# FITTING (`overlay fit.<v>`): P-box fits (`tags tile overlay fit`, `on-region P`: the largest <w>x<h> view that fits
# the piece's panel, centred: bosses, star rivets, knotwork), seam fittings (`on-region N`, a periodic tile on the seams
# the cut marks: rivets), or plane tiles (`on-slot:<slot>`, as a cut: studs, scored lines, the inlay band, lacing).
# Cells as the limb tile's (region tiles) or the cut tile's (plane tiles).
use person
role overlay fit.stars
tags tile overlay fit
on-region P
legend + ink 3
legend ^ ink 4
legend : ink 1
legend = ink 0
legend O metal2 2

view D key stars3x3 origin 0 0
|.+.
|+++
|.+.

view D key stars7x3 origin 0 0
|.+...+.
|+++.+++
|.+...+.

view D key stars5x5 origin 0 0
|..+..
|..+..
|+++++
|..+..
|..+..

view D key stars7x6 origin 0 0
|.+...+.
|+++.+++
|.+...+.
|...+...
|..+++..
|...+...

